Short:        Strip ANSI Sequences from a file (src)
Author:       jma@lpa.com (Jon Armstrong)
Uploader:     jma lpa com (Jon Armstrong)
Type:         dev/src
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This huge utility strips a few ANSI-ish sequences from any file.
It does not try to replace the escape sequences, just strip them.

I've tried a number of existing utilities, but most don't seem
to catch standard sequences.

The (flex) source is included in the archive with instructions
for making the executable with GNU-C.

Have fun... Jon
